OL,3,GNEWSAOlympians bidding for English
OL,4,AChannel swim record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of Olympic swimmers are hoping
OL,7,Fto break the record for swimming the
OL,8,FEnglish Channel in a relay.
OL,10,FThe record for the 33 km (20.5 miles)
OL,11,Fswim from Dover to Cap Gris-Nez in
OL,12,FFrance currently stands at six hours
OL,13,Fand 52 minutes, set by the United
OL,14,FStates National Swimming Team in 1990.
OL,16,FThe British swimmers will make their
OL,17,Fattempt between 15 and 25 September
OL,18,Fdepending on the weather, and will
OL,19,Fraise money for the charity Royal Life
OL,20,FSaving Society UK (RLSS).
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
