OL,3,GNEWSAOlympians bidding for English
OL,4,AChannel swim record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe team is triple Olympic gold
OL,7,Fmedallist Tom Dean and his fellow
OL,8,Ffreestyler Daniel Jervis, open water
OL,9,Fspecialists George Taplin, Tobias
OL,10,FRobinson and double Olympic champion
OL,11,FHector Pardoe, and British champion
OL,12,FJoshua Gammon.
